        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/paul/{size}/5862_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-09-26T17:36:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Egads! A rare usage of the Announcements board!</p><p>This forum has grown significantly in size in the last year, and we anticipate that it will only increase further over the course of the next. In order to facilitate continued forumnal harmony, we have elected to increase the number of moderators to 3.</p><p><span>To that end, we are pleased to announce the addition of <strong>imprimis5</strong> as a moderator!</span></p><p><span>The GTG Forum: Now With 50% More Moderation!</span></p>",
